// Title: Potential Netcat Reverse Shell Execution
// Rule ID: 7f734ed0-4f47-46c0-837f-6ee62505abd9
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
